PetalburgCity_House2_Text_NormanBecameGymLeader:
	.string "ELIAS: Some guilt does not\n"
	.string "vanish when we stay silent.\p"
	.string "I approved part of the M'BOI\n"
	.string "project and spent years calling\n"
	.string "my fear prudence.$"

PetalburgCity_House2_Text_BattledNormanOnce:
	.string "ELIAS: Being your father never\n"
	.string "gave me the right to choose what\n"
	.string "truth you could bear.\p"
	.string "I understood that too late.$"

